# The community fortress, walking: the choke-walk half of the turtle meta.
#
# imp-fortress12 measured the STATIC half of the community claim and it died
# faster than mobile trades (0/12, survival 2812 vs the champion's 3380).
# The half the community actually describes is the walk: creep the wall
# toward the choke and hold it there, every third structure a repair bay,
# riposte when a wave breaks (log 2026-08-07, the fortress screen; log
# 2026-07-31, the creep verb's hold-point rebuild). fortress.doctrine one
# field apart: creep 50 -- hold at the midpoint of the anchor-to-enemy
# line. The pre-certification bastion probe on fire_bridge said the wall
# starves the army at 3.7x; this arm re-asks that on the certified harness.

name fortress-creep
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,repairbay
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 40
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 50
riposte 1
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
decoys 0
